的遺體18日在北京八寶山革命公墓火化。（央視）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"朱鎔基的遺體18日在北京八寶山革命公墓火化。（央視）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166461671107989504024956.png/PMefBMUKDMqo73tI1mAZushJMj4Hvd1GLMhVoizIVaI\"/><figcaption>朱鎔基的遺體18日在北京八寶山革命公墓火化。（央視）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"新華社公布朱鎔基遺像。（新華社）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260812/1164306788623847424182506.jpeg/5K10XgAKRJGQPsaso1VmikotKRSk8bA7rxLycq8S8nI\"/><figcaption>新華社公布朱鎔基遺像。（新華社）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-18T13:53:29.692562+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":865,"images":16,"source":"HK01 中國","fallback":"none"}}